  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe buttons in the Camera Mode sub menu don't play their interact sound effect.\n\nThis is different from other sub menus, as well as from what they do on live.\n\nFor some reason the Multi Layer button is the only button that still plays it's interaction sound.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe buttons in the Camera Mode sub menu should play an interaction sound effect, just like they do on live.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a video show casing the issue:\n\nhttps://streamable.com/pfk6y6",
